# Secrets
.env

# Data (1.4GB+ of cached API responses, downloaded CSVs, derived parquet).
# Leading slash matters: a bare `data/` would also swallow src/data/.
/data/
# (v1/data is a committed relative symlink -> ../data, so v1 scripts still
#  resolve Path(__file__).parent.parent/"data" after the move into v1/.)

# Trained model checkpoints (same anchoring reason — src/models/ is source)
/models/

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# The v1 browser dashboard's bundle. Generated by v1/scripts/build_web_bundle.py
# from /data/, and deliberately unpublished: it carries SportMonks fixture ids and
# bookmaker odds, which are their data to redistribute rather than ours. Run that
# script to rebuild it locally.
v1/web/data.json
